ds4j NOTICE
===========

ds4j is a Java reimplementation of the ds4.c / ds4-server inference
engine (the "ds4 C implementation", MIT licensed). The Java code is a
derivative work of that implementation: it reproduces the engine's
numerics, API and behavior, though little source text is copied.

The released jar embeds generated kernel sources and data files (under
resources/):

  metal/prelude.metal
      Metal kernels from ds4 C implementation
  metal/gen/*.metal
      Metal kernels generated by TileLang from the TileLang
      implementations of the hand-written Metal kernels in the ds4
      C implementation
  iq2/ds4_iq2_tables.h
      IQ2_XXS quantization codebook tables originating from
      ggml / llama.cpp, redistributed verbatim.

